/target

# Real clinical data — never commit PHI.
#
# These are patterns rather than exact names. An exact-name rule let a stray
# clinical JPEG 2000 image be swept in by `git add -A` and live in history, so
# medical image formats are now denied by default. For a genuinely public sample,
# add it deliberately and visibly: `git add -f <path>`.
*.dcm
*.jp2
*.j2k
DICOMDIR
1.2.*/
1.3.*/

# Machine-specific dev toolchain config: absolute linker paths plus a global
# `[build] target` that would override the target every other builder picks.
# Regenerate it locally with `scripts/setup-toolchain.sh`.
.cargo/config.toml
